  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping Review of the Science, Research and Innovation Landscape in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To identify opportunities to strengthen research and innovation (R&amp;I) ecosystems in Southeast Asia, including the ASEAN member countries, with the aim of delivering development impact and foster inclusive economic growth in the region. Specifically, the research project aims to a) map the R&amp;I landscape, b) identify gaps and barriers that hinder regional R&amp;I collaboration in Southeast Asia, and c) explore opportunities for long-term intra-regional and international engagements.</narrative>
  </description>
